cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Head2Field, please cite the paper "Head2Field: A Continuous Neural
  Field for Subject-Specific Multi-Electrode Transcranial Electrical Stimulation
  Lead-Field Prediction from Structural MRI", this software, and the relevant methods and data sources.
title: "Head2Field"
type: software
version: "0.1.0rc1"
authors:
  - name: "Head2Field Contributors"
abstract: >-
  Official implementation of Head2Field for continuous, subject-specific,
  multi-electrode tES lead-field prediction from structural MRI. Includes
  T1-derived head preparation, Oz-referenced SimNIBS FEM labels, physics-guided
  CUDA training, and label-free inference.
keywords:
  - Head2Field
  - transcranial electrical stimulation
  - lead field
  - subject-specific modeling
  - PyTorch
  - SimNIBS
license: GPL-3.0-only
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: >-
    Head2Field: A Continuous Neural Field for Subject-Specific Multi-Electrode
    Transcranial Electrical Stimulation Lead-Field Prediction from Structural
    MRI
